tempora.command.region_rule.help.description=Turns a logger ON or OFF inside a region, or clears the rule. Where regions overlap, the smallest one with a rule for that logger decides, and ON wins between equally sized regions. Where no region has a rule, the logger's logByDefault config applies.
tempora.command.region_rule.help.arg0=Label of the region.
tempora.command.region_rule.help.arg1=Logger to set the rule for, or all for every logger.
tempora.command.region_rule.help.arg2=on to always log here, off to never log here, clear to remove the rule.
