tempora.command.region_rule.no_rule=Region %s has no rule for %s, nothing to clear.
tempora.command.region_rule.logger_disabled=Note: %s is disabled in the config (isEnabled=false), so it won't log anywhere until that is turned back on.

tempora.command.region_check.help.description=Shows whether each logger records events where you are standing, and which region or config option decided it.
